 sycl/setup_intel.py                           |  1 +
 sycl/src/core/gguf_expert_source.cpp          | 91 ++++++++++++-------
 sycl/src/program/generate.cpp                 |  6 +-
 4 files changed, 68 insertions(+), 39 deletions(-)

